1
00:00:00,234 --> 00:00:03,324
(Penny:)Look, Leonard, you have to know
how much I care about you.

2
00:00:03,488 --> 00:00:06,408
(Penny:)It's just that I've said the L word
too soon before...

3
00:00:06,574 --> 00:00:08,284
(Penny:)...and it didn't work out very well.

4
00:00:08,701 --> 00:00:11,491
(Raj:)Really?
I wouldn't know what that's like.

5
00:00:12,205 --> 00:00:13,415
(Penny:)I'm sorry.

6
00:00:13,581 --> 00:00:15,791
(Raj:)-You know what I'm talking about.
-Yeah, I do.

7
00:00:17,251 --> 00:00:20,211
(Penny:)-So we're good?
-Yes, that's what I'm telling you.

8
00:00:20,379 --> 00:00:22,089
(Leonard:)We are good. We are great.

9
00:00:22,256 --> 00:00:25,546
All right. Fence mended,
problem swept under the rug.

10
00:00:25,718 --> 00:00:27,138
(Sheldon:)Time to bowl.

11
00:00:29,055 --> 00:00:31,345
(Sheldon:)Yes, I was eavesdropping.
There's a lot at stake.

12
00:00:34,602 --> 00:00:36,312
(Sheldon:)Attention, all bowlers...

13
00:00:36,479 --> 00:00:41,319
(Sheldon:)...I've taken the liberty
of having these made for our rematch.

14
00:00:42,109 --> 00:00:44,699
(Penny:)-The Wesley Crushers?
-No, not the Wesley Crushers.

15
00:00:44,862 --> 00:00:47,032
The Wesley "Crushers."

16
00:00:47,448 --> 00:00:49,538
(Penny:)-I don't get it.
-Wesley Crusher...

17
00:00:49,742 --> 00:00:51,992
(Leonard:)...was Wil Wheaton's character
on Star Trek.

18
00:00:52,161 --> 00:00:53,621
(Penny:)Still don't get it.

19
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:55,870
(Sheldon:)It's a blindingly clever play on words.

20
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)By appropriating his character's
name and adding the S...

